pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: obj-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 44, 480, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [left, middle]
      text: LECTURE 3 · OBJECTIVES
  - elementId: obj-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 76, 640, 52]
    content:
      fontSize: 34
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.2
      align: [left, middle]
      text: By the end you can…
  - elementId: obj-progress
    elementType: text
    bounds: [836, 44, 60, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 2 / 7
  - elementId: obj-num-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 160, 56, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "01"
  - elementId: obj-text-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [136, 158, 560, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Explain what a 95% interval does and does not contain.
  - elementId: obj-num-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 244, 56, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "02"
  - elementId: obj-text-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [136, 242, 560, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Compute the interval from a sample mean and standard error.
  - elementId: obj-num-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 328, 56, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "03"
  - elementId: obj-text-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [136, 326, 560, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Diagnose a claim that the interval cannot support.
  - elementId: obj-check-band
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 420, 832, 64]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primarySoft"}
  - elementId: obj-check-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 432, 784, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "Check: you can state the interval and one claim it rules out, without rereading the slides."
  - elementId: obj-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 504, 28, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei"
      color: "$muted"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "02"
